-- הבהרה לחוזר תשפ"ה/8 (7.5.2025): הגשת בקשה לתקצוב שעות פרופסיונליות בשנה"ל תשפ"ה בשל השינוי במבנה שבוע העבודה בחטיבות העליונות
-- A one-line clarification of circular תשפ"ה/8: it attaches the link to the
-- commitment letter that an owning body signs to receive the normative
-- budgeting of professional hours for תשפ"ה.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rule is counted in days from this clarification
-- (7.5.2025 = day 0); circular תשפ"ה/8 sets 25.5.2025, day 18, as the last
-- day to sign.

§ `הבהרה לתשפ"ה/8 כתב ההתחייבות`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/p8 akn:hc_1/p9 akn:hc_1/p10 akn:hc_1/p11 The letterhead, date (7.5.2025), reference number, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- akn:hc_1/p12 A pointer back to circular תשפ"ה/8 of 4.5.2025, whose rules are encoded in its own file.

DECLARE `commitment action` IS ONE OF
    `sign the commitment letter at the attached link` HAS `institutions covered` IS A NUMBER

-- p13: the commitment letter for the normative budgeting of professional
-- hours in תשפ"ה is signed through the link the clarification attaches.
-- Circular תשפ"ה/8 (ו.ב.2.2-2.3) makes the signature cover every upper
-- division the body owns and sets 25.5.2025 as its last day; those are
-- inputs here, from that circular. The link itself is a hyperlink on the
-- page that the corpus text does not carry.
@ref akn:hc_1/p13
GIVEN `upper divisions the body owns` IS A NUMBER, `days from this clarification to the last day to sign under circular 8` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `commitment action`
DECIDE `sign the commitment letter for normative budgeting` `upper divisions the body owns` `days from this clarification to the last day to sign under circular 8` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `sign the commitment letter at the attached link` n
          PROVIDED n EQUALS `upper divisions the body owns`
    WITHIN `days from this clarification to the last day to sign under circular 8`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off, signatures, the list of copies and the office's address footer; no rule.

-- Example: a body owning three upper divisions signs for all three on 20.5.2025 (day 13).
#TRACE `sign the commitment letter for normative budgeting` 3 18 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `sign the commitment letter at the attached link` 3 AT 13
